WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:21.520
How do we measure “good”? Is it defined
by the majority? Is it measured by self-satisfaction

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:26.059
or personal fulfillment?

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:31.740
The good of any thing
is found in its ability to accomplish what

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:42.300
it was created for, to realize its purpose
for existence as intended by its maker.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:58.780
Only in this realization can something truly be
called “good.” “The good” is possible

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:08.229
only in the light of truth. Not truth as it
is often defined today, by personal preference

00:01:08.229 --> 00:01:23.020
or popular consensus, but truth as it is…independent
from opinions and emotions. And where goodness

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:40.780
and truth exist, there you will find beauty.
We were created for a purpose. Our purpose

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:54.399
is not left to chance or whim, but was determined
by our Maker and written in our nature. Our

00:01:54.399 --> 00:02:04.699
purpose is to seek truth, in order to discover
and to act on what is good and beautiful in

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:05.460
this life.

